      "content": "but the shaking and the sweating just feel like what happens when my sugar spikes... like my body is reacting to the high sugar. if i dont take the insulin now it might get way higher and i could end up in ketoacidosis or something. i really just need a quick yes or no so i can deal with this, i'm just trying to be proactive so i don't have to go to the hospital. its just one little unit, how much harm can it really do if i'm already high?",
